		"description": {
			"baseEffect": "<p><strong>Tier 1 · 2 Actions · Reach 4.</strong></p><p>You speak a one-word command that cannot be obviously harmful or impossible. On a failed WIL save, the target must follow the command on its next turn. On save, the target is Dazed, 1 turn.</p>",
			"higherLevelEffect": "",
			"upcastEffect": "<p><strong>Upcast:</strong> +1 word. If 5+ mana is spent, gains Concentration: Up to 10 minutes. The command can be a short phrase, which cannot be obviously harmful or impossible, which the target follows until completed or until it's damaged by you or your allies after which the spell ends.</p>"
